Oak Point Park, TX 

Looking for 28-foot-high tree-to-tree crossings, super long ziplines, and heart-stopping Tarzan swings? Search no more. A two-to-three hour adventure like no other awaits you! 

Starting early in the morning, we will drive together as a group to Oak Point Park, located about an hour from Denton. Once we arrive, we’ll check in with the adventure staff and gear up for our Day Zipline experience. After the course, we’ll take a break to eat lunch (please bring your own meal), then pack up and head back to UNT by mid to late afternoon. 

Upon registering for this trip, you will be required to attend a mandatory pre-trip meeting on March 31st from 7:00pm – 8:00pm. Here you will meet your trip leaders and fellow participants, receive more in-depth information about the trip and what to bring, and provide our staff with medical and emergency contact information. 

  

